OL,3,GNEWSAIslands renew electricity import
OL,4,Adeal with EDF
OL,5,
OL,6,FElectricity companies in Guernsey and
OL,7,FJersey have signed a new four-year
OL,8,Fcontract with EDF energy to continue
OL,9,Fimporting electricity from Europe from
OL,10,F2028.
OL,12,FThe agreement will take effect on 1
OL,13,FJanuary 2028, when the islands' current
OL,14,Fagreement with the French energy
OL,15,Fcompany comes to an end.
OL,17,FCurrently most of electricity needed
OL,18,Ffor the islands is met through imported
OL,19,Fpower supplied via subsea cables
OL,20,Flinking them to the European grid
OL,21,Fthrough the Channel Islands Electricity
OL,22,FGrid network.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
