OL,3,GNEWSAIslands renew electricity import
OL,4,Adeal with EDF
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey Electricity chief executive
OL,7,FAlan Bates said the deal would help
OL,8,Fsecure the islands' energy supply while
OL,9,Fsupporting efforts to cut carbon
OL,10,Femissions.
